id: pm-lulgxc
title: Adopt TruffleHog 3.99.9 from Dependabot PR #1771 with the matching workflow contract and executed version input
description: "Dependabot GH PR #1771 moves trufflesecurity/trufflehog in .github/workflows/security.yml from v3.99.8 (ea68ca03c865) to v3.99.9 (3bd2b5887eb0) but leaves the executed version input at 3.99.8 and does not move the exact-pin assertions in tests/integration/ci-workflow-contract.spec.ts, so its Coverage shard 1/4 fails 'keeps security workflow downloads pinned and hash-verified'. v3.99.9 was published 2026-11-12, past the seven-day age floor, and its tag dereferences to 3bd2b5887eb0efb8fa18bfd1d296032924e4ffdc. Duplicate check: searched trufflehog pin bump dependabot workflow contract; pm-ey1zh7 (3.99.7) and earlier adoptions are closed."
